;; ==============================================================
;; SKDT – Dual Sunyata Structures and Emergent Category Theory
;; --------------------------------------------------------------
;; Title   : Emergence of Category Theory from Dual Sunyata Structures
;; Author  : Masaomi Chiba
;; Date    : 2025‑12‑01
;; Version : 1.0
